                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94312267-c458-4760-906c-49bf8067d6a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d5abb1d-b617-35c4-ba91-5d43de8bdeaa",
                        "source_sense_id": "d1fcd979-1706-3c20-90ee-73ecce7af3c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "slippery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "slippery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd2f33f1-eb4a-30a2-a2f3-4df00ee16d2e",
                                        "entry_id": "286f4dc1-2d42-3b7e-9202-87878fcea8ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a surface, having low friction, often due to being covered in a non-viscous liquid, and therefore hard to grip, hard to stand on without falling, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77afe761-4d29-43de-99e3-4e24b8a94138",
                                                "sense_id": "bd2f33f1-eb4a-30a2-a2f3-4df00ee16d2e",
                                                "text": "Oily substances render things slippery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46b3dca2-fb29-442c-b7fc-72940fc05c18",
                                                "sense_id": "bd2f33f1-eb4a-30a2-a2f3-4df00ee16d2e",
                                                "text": "The screeching of brakes, the monotonous blare of motor horns, the clip-clip of shoes on slippery pavements, the rustling of wet mackintoshes were all part of the great metropolis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "232bcd86-752f-3c61-80df-0194048c7ad5",
                                        "entry_id": "286f4dc1-2d42-3b7e-9202-87878fcea8ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Evasive; difficult to pin down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cd8ce2a-80ae-4bdd-a551-9e981c8fbe0e",
                                                "sense_id": "232bcd86-752f-3c61-80df-0194048c7ad5",
                                                "text": "a slippery person"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee119ab5-a160-4900-9a25-9c7544b4d04a",
                                                "sense_id": "232bcd86-752f-3c61-80df-0194048c7ad5",
                                                "text": "a slippery promise"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2907adfd-205f-308b-b971-e07502e1ee8d",
                                        "entry_id": "286f4dc1-2d42-3b7e-9202-87878fcea8ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Liable to slip; not standing firm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65f4d87f-70f7-44d7-925a-a2c0de7aca1a",
                                                "sense_id": "2907adfd-205f-308b-b971-e07502e1ee8d",
                                                "text": "Which when they fall, as being slippery standers, / The love that leaned on them, as slippery too, / Do one pluck down another, and together / Die in the fall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f3d8950-6318-31ce-bafd-e38cbdf606c3",
                                        "entry_id": "286f4dc1-2d42-3b7e-9202-87878fcea8ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unstable; changeable; inconstant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "417e8e5d-56fb-4644-be49-3899a1441548",
                                                "sense_id": "6f3d8950-6318-31ce-bafd-e38cbdf606c3",
                                                "text": "He looking down\nWith scorn or pity on the slippery state\nOf kings, will tread upon the neck of fate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e22c3349-cfca-3960-9652-0f25ce260b29",
                                        "entry_id": "286f4dc1-2d42-3b7e-9202-87878fcea8ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wanton; unchaste; loose in morals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "513388dc-2d7b-407b-bf3d-6c85d87a4afd",
                                                "sense_id": "e22c3349-cfca-3960-9652-0f25ce260b29",
                                                "text": "My wife is slippery? If thou wilt confess –"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c767ee45-3176-477a-a1be-15c55898a945",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d5abb1d-b617-35c4-ba91-5d43de8bdeaa",
                        "source_sense_id": "d1fcd979-1706-3c20-90ee-73ecce7af3c8",
                        "target_lang_word": "glissant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glissant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f3c9d03-d123-3ab7-b926-0e6f05b30224",
                                        "entry_id": "331736a8-ea9f-33ce-a721-0231ca4741cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sur quoi l’on glisse facilement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b643df99-8f62-4bfb-8fc5-8daa6b3f39c6",
                                                "sense_id": "6f3c9d03-d123-3ab7-b926-0e6f05b30224",
                                                "text": "Georges poussa la porte, ouverte comme d’habitude. Il traversa à pas comptés le hall au carrelage glissant, trop bien astiqué, et commença de monter l'escalier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31baf361-2098-49b7-8f5a-e3df92ce9f5f",
                                                "sense_id": "6f3c9d03-d123-3ab7-b926-0e6f05b30224",
                                                "text": "Secouant l’éventail et le chasse-mouches de leur queue aux lueurs glissantes d’une blancheur dorée comme les rayons de la lune, les vaches grognantes n’y font-elles pas concorder le mot avec la chose dans son nom de roi des montagnes ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8f2c3a1-3caf-3dc8-a16e-5e9c45f9d029",
                                        "entry_id": "331736a8-ea9f-33ce-a721-0231ca4741cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui se déplace en glissant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f2cd597-c1c7-475f-855b-ed37a53fe468",
                                                "sense_id": "d8f2c3a1-3caf-3dc8-a16e-5e9c45f9d029",
                                                "text": "L’entreprise SeaBubbles propose, jusqu’à la fin du mois d’août, deux allers-retours entre les Marquisats et Veyrier-du-Lac à bord de bateaux glissants, rapporte France 3 Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c7ce63d-7c08-3f55-bae0-0c52d85a9f4d",
                                        "entry_id": "331736a8-ea9f-33ce-a721-0231ca4741cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Continu, s’enchaînant, parlant d’une durée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d460d00b-1edc-43e3-8b4f-3970dd26b9dc",
                                                "sense_id": "0c7ce63d-7c08-3f55-bae0-0c52d85a9f4d",
                                                "text": "Le rem, c’est l’ancien système. Aujourd’hui le sievert. Ce que chacun vient vendre c’est ça, vingt millisieverts, la dose maximale d’irradiation autorisée sur douze mois glissants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "glissant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92392298-e89d-3265-977a-20ca1ff9c75f",
                                        "entry_id": "3f233415-658a-338c-957a-fcfa083c354b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propension ou capacité à glisser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a93db68c-0a5d-493e-9146-ec4f53f70512",
                                                "sense_id": "92392298-e89d-3265-977a-20ca1ff9c75f",
                                                "text": "Le glissant est généralement apporté par une addition d’érucamide dont le pourcentage dépend de la cadence de la machine. Les plus rapides demandent un coefficient de glissabilité de l'ordre de 0,15 à 0,18 et les autres acceptent un coefficient de 0,25 à 0,30."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "glissant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ab97468-e7b2-3f96-94db-b064de902344",
                                        "entry_id": "afda5c69-1aae-3eba-be8c-8918042004b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Participe présent de glisser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32f41428-fafd-46d2-9c49-dba5529febd6",
                                                "sense_id": "6ab97468-e7b2-3f96-94db-b064de902344",
                                                "text": "Maintenant, il se rapprochait de moi en glissant son gros derrière sur la banquette."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdcc1a4a-83f6-4d7d-a450-88556667d96d",
                                                "sense_id": "6ab97468-e7b2-3f96-94db-b064de902344",
                                                "text": "Car notre Europe, à qui justement venait de naître un penseur comme Nietzsche, pour qui seules les joies de l’esprit rendent notre lourde terre habitable, cette Europe n’avait, Dieu le sait, pas la moindre envie de se laisser soudain, sur un simple commandement moral, rusticiser, abêtir et mongoliser, en se glissant docilement sous la kibitka et d’adjurer, comme une erreur « coupable », un splendide passé intellectuel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bef41540-0625-423b-9ccc-c1900026e49a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d5abb1d-b617-35c4-ba91-5d43de8bdeaa",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9e411e6-934c-356d-aa5c-485b5280aad9",
                        "target_lang_word": "tricky",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tricky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hard to deal with, complicated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7a79d6f-7615-4e62-ab87-5cc6585a7988",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "They were in a tricky situation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6f4b0aa-82ea-47cd-b7fe-76ba57742dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "Several types of diesel locomotive have been tested on this working and as a result the probable choice will be Type 2 diesels in pairs, without bankers. The crucial factor in the selection of this method is the higher degree of adhesion obtained than with a single Type 4; on trial one of the latter showed that in very adverse conditions it might slip to a standstill at one of the two tricky spots on the steep climb from Tyne Dock to Consett."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a9b563-63c9-4d05-8761-81531996bc7d",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "\"The trickiest we ever get,\" he continued, \"is in the short-answer questions like, 'Why do you want to come to the University of Chicago?' or, 'What books have you read?'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14b4ca2e-d692-4b44-b25f-5f2a71c8ad78",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "That will prove a trickier test, the management having pinpointed Oleh Blokhin's side as \"one of the favourites in the group\", though they will confront an England team buoyed by this battering."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "232fa869-e755-4561-8511-6f2658a6de05",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "It was as comfortable an afternoon as Arsène Wenger could have wished for in a situation that can be tricky in between internationals and the upcoming Champions League."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adept at using deception."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b1d85cc-cfbd-4480-93da-8bb721709ddf",
                                                "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                                "text": "Clever got me this far\nThen tricky got me in\nEye on what I'm after\nI don't need another friend"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99be29ca-e386-4678-806f-e3bfba9bf4a1",
                                                "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                                "text": "A tricky salesman can sell anything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34312463-e39d-3659-9350-6a412d01bb4f",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to or associated with a prostitution trick."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43bfc63-d20f-4e68-96f8-b009b6984619",
                                                "sense_id": "34312463-e39d-3659-9350-6a412d01bb4f",
                                                "text": "I don't want any of your tricky money, thank you!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ace86422-a8fd-40bd-b060-61cfa27bfb7a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d5abb1d-b617-35c4-ba91-5d43de8bdeaa",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9e411e6-934c-356d-aa5c-485b5280aad9",
                        "target_lang_word": "precarious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "precarious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95529245-de0d-3578-97a9-c968c58c8f5f",
                                        "entry_id": "dd97e961-b3cf-37a7-9c50-ccfe5e1b79e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dangerously insecure or unstable; perilous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae999bf3-3dfe-4e8d-9c00-30827ab51119",
                                                "sense_id": "95529245-de0d-3578-97a9-c968c58c8f5f",
                                                "text": "One morning I had been driven to the precarious refuge afforded by the steps of the inn, after rejecting offers from the Celebrity to join him in a variety of amusements. But even here I was not free from interruption, for he was seated on a horse-block below me, playing with a fox terrier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d71d03cc-2c5f-47ad-9f72-73ad99ab87f9",
                                                "sense_id": "95529245-de0d-3578-97a9-c968c58c8f5f",
                                                "text": "Never had he been so fond of this body of his as now when his tenure of it was so precarious."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "345262c4-19ff-4c49-af55-cea800155e71",
                                                "sense_id": "95529245-de0d-3578-97a9-c968c58c8f5f",
                                                "text": "The existence of Jewish partisans was precarious. They lived from hand to mouth, stealing when necessary, arranging secret deliveries of food, and spending hours and even days in holes in the ground when danger threatened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b2c141a-14a6-49ce-83e3-c4b00c7d853a",
                                                "sense_id": "95529245-de0d-3578-97a9-c968c58c8f5f",
                                                "text": "One can't escape the huge nuclear facility at Sellafield (supplier of much of the line's remaining freight traffic), or miss the wild shingle beaches with exposed and precarious bungalows sandwiched between the railway and the shore at Braystones."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bdf6813-4d72-3170-b12c-149ed6ee2353",
                                        "entry_id": "dd97e961-b3cf-37a7-9c50-ccfe5e1b79e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Depending on the intention of another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
